<quiz>
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Velocity and displacement from acceleration</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>A particle moves in a straight line. At time \(t\) seconds its acceleration is \(a = {@at@}\) m/s\(^2\). When \(t = 0\) its velocity is \({@uu@}\) m/s and it is at the point \(O\).</p><p>(a) Find its velocity \(v\) in terms of \(t\).</p><div>\(v =\) [[input:ans1]] m/s [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div><p>(b) Find its displacement \(s\) from \(O\) in terms of \(t\).</p><div>\(s =\) [[input:ans2]] m [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div><p>(c) Find its displacement from \(O\) when \(t = {@Tend@}\).</p><div>\(s =\) [[input:ans3]] m [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>Integrate to go from acceleration to velocity and from velocity to displacement, using what you know at the start to find each constant.</p><p>(a) \(v = \displaystyle\int \left({@at@}\right)dt = {@pp*t+qq/2*t^2@} + c\). When \(t = 0\), \(v = {@uu@}\), so \(c = {@uu@}\) and \(v = {@vt@}\).</p><p>(b) \(s = \displaystyle\int \left({@vt@}\right)dt = {@st@} + c\). When \(t = 0\), \(s = 0\), so \(c = 0\) and \(s = {@st@}\).</p><p>(c) When \(t = {@Tend@}\), \(s = {@sT@}\) m.</p><p>Check by differentiating: \(\dfrac{ds}{dt} = {@vt@}\) and \(\dfrac{dv}{dt} = {@at@}\).</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>3</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
  <idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2026063000</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables>
    <text><![CDATA[validate_tc(ex) := if every(lambda([v], member(v, [t, c, C])), listofvars(ex)) then "" else "Use t for time (and c for a constant of integration).";
/* Design: [p, q, u, T]: a = p + q t, v(0) = u, s(0) = 0. Source: original. */
L: [[4,6,3,2],[6,-6,2,3],[2,12,4,1],[8,-6,1,2],[10,6,4,3],[4,-12,6,1],[2,6,8,2],[12,-6,3,2],[6,12,2,1],[8,6,7,3]];
ix: 1+rand(10);
pp: L[ix][1]; qq: L[ix][2]; uu: L[ix][3]; Tend: L[ix][4];
at: pp+qq*t;
vt: uu+pp*t+qq/2*t^2;
st: uu*t+pp/2*t^2+qq/6*t^3;
sT: subst(t=Tend, st);
/* diagnostics */
vnou: pp*t+qq/2*t^2;
vnodiv: uu+pp*t+qq*t^2;
snout: pp/2*t^2+qq/6*t^3;
vT: subst(t=Tend, vt);
su: sT+uu;
/* test values */
snoutT: subst(t=Tend, snout);
ft2: st+t^2/2;
ftT: sT+Tend^2/2;]]></text>
  </questionvariables>
